+## HTTPS
+
+To serve the REST API, UI, and gRPC with TLS, set `server.protocol` to `https` and supply an existing certificate and private key file. The REST API and UI listen on `server.https_port`; gRPC continues to listen on `server.grpc_port` with TLS enabled.
+
+```yaml
+server:
+  protocol: https
+  https_port: 443
+  cert_file: /etc/flipt/tls/cert.pem
+  cert_key: /etc/flipt/tls/key.pem
+```
+
